### 创建菜单
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/menu/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "用户导出",
  "permission": "system:user:export",
  "type": 3,
  "sort": 7,
  "parentId": 101,
  "status": 0,
  "visible": true
}

### 修改菜单
PUT {{baseUrl}}/system/menu/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1015,
  "name": "用户导出",
  "permission": "system:user:export",
  "type": 3,
  "sort": 7,
  "parentId": 101,
  "status": 0,
  "visible": true
}

### 删除菜单
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/system/menu/delete?id=1015
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取菜单
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/menu/get?id=101
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获取全部菜单列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/menu/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
